WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:02.113
Here's how it works.

00:02.113 --> 00:06.092
Step one: choose your plan.
Starter, Pro, or your own volume.

00:06.092 --> 00:09.271
You pay securely by card, via Stripe.

00:09.271 --> 00:13.674
Step two: set your focus.
Right after payment, you get a short form.

00:13.674 --> 00:18.374
Pick the signals and the kind of companies you want.
It takes two minutes.

00:18.374 --> 00:22.839
Step three: your personal contact.
Someone who looks after you, and only you.

00:22.839 --> 00:26.788
Talk through your leads at any time.
Tell them what works, and what doesn't.

00:26.788 --> 00:31.216
Your contact puts your feedback into practice,
and fine-tunes your leads with you.

00:31.216 --> 00:34.690
So over time, you have a
say in which leads you get.

00:34.690 --> 00:36.987
Step four: leads every Monday.

00:36.987 --> 00:41.977
From the following Monday, a fresh PDF
briefing and spreadsheet land in your inbox.

00:41.977 --> 00:45.280
Every lead goes to one
firm in your field only.

00:45.280 --> 00:47.257
Start your weekly leads.
